  <!-- EN: shard insanity lance -->

  <Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.label>kıymık delilik mızrağı</Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.label>

  <!-- EN: A limited-use psychic effector. It overwhelms the target's mind with terrifying perceptual distortions, driving them into a berserk state. There is a risk of brain damage.\n\nThis insanity lance was crafted from a broken shard of dark archotechnology. It has a shorter range than its non-shard based counterpart and it requires line of sight. -->

  <Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.description>Sınırlı kullanımlık bir psişik etkileyici. Hedefin zihnini dehşet verici algı bozulmalarıyla boğarak onu cinnet hâline sürükler. Beyin hasarı riski vardır.\n\nBu delilik mızrağı, karanlık arkoteknolojinin kırık bir kıymığından üretilmiştir. Kıymık bazlı olmayan muadilinden daha kısa menzillidir ve görüş hattı gerektirir.</Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.description>

  <!-- EN: charge -->

  <Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>şarj</Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>

  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->

  <Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>bekleme süresinde</Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>

  <!-- EN: shard insanity lance -->

  <Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.verbs.shard_insanity_lance.label>kıymık delilik mızrağı</Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.verbs.shard_insanity_lance.label>

  <!-- EN: psychic insanity immune -->

  <Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.verbs.shard_insanity_lance.invalidTargetPawn>psişik deliliğe bağışık</Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.verbs.shard_insanity_lance.invalidTargetPawn>

  

  <!-- EN: shard shock lance -->

  <Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.label>kıymık şok mızrağı</Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.label>

  <!-- EN: A limited-use psychic effector. It shocks the target's mind with chaotic images, blocking coherent perception and dropping them into a state of psychic shock. There is a risk of brain damage.\n\nThis shock lance was crafted from a broken shard of dark archotechnology. It has a shorter range than its non-shard based counterpart and it requires line of sight. -->

  <Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.description>Sınırlı kullanımlık bir psişik etkileyici. Hedefin zihnini kaotik görüntülerle sarsarak tutarlı algıyı engeller ve onu psişik şok hâline sokar. Beyin hasarı riski vardır.\n\nBu şok mızrağı, karanlık arkoteknolojinin kırık bir kıymığından üretilmiştir. Kıymık bazlı olmayan muadilinden daha kısa menzillidir ve görüş hattı gerektirir.</Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.description>

  <!-- EN: charge -->

  <Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>şarj</Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>

  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->

  <Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>bekleme süresinde</Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>

  <!-- EN: shard shock lance -->

  <Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.verbs.shard_shock_lance.label>kıymık şok mızrağı</Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.verbs.shard_shock_lance.label>

  <!-- EN: psychic shock immune -->

  <Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.verbs.shard_shock_lance.invalidTargetPawn>psişik şoka bağışık</Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.verbs.shard_shock_lance.invalidTargetPawn>

  

